{1000}{Mayor of Gray-heels want me to get Mummy dat be skaring pee-pol. Mayor rekon dat Mummy be in dark cayves owtside of town.}
{1001}{Funny guy Tim, da Gossip of Grayheels, say dat book at lib-rare-eee 'Da Storee of Amtut' be wat me need to reed. Wonce me red book, Tim wan' me go talk to him. Tim say dat book haf' moor info 'bout da Mummy.}
{1002}{Da Librareean from da Grayheels Public Libraree want me ta get da overdoo book 'All Guns Blazin'. It was lent to da Bartender of 'Da Rathowse'.}
{1003}{Da Bartender of 'Da Rathowse' want me ta kill all da rats in his sellar.}
{1004}{Tim, da Gossip of Grayheels, say dat me need to speek to Mr Pollock an' find owt moor 'bout da Mummy. Tim say dat he be kuttin' fiyerwood down Sheerars Driyve on da suthern owtskerts of town.}
{1005}{Da Sheep Farmer, Mr Pollock, need his axe reepared so dat he kan kut down da trees an' yuse dem as firewood for da  winter.}
{1006}{Mr Pollock want me to kut down da free Big Trees at da end of da path for him.}
{1007}{Me haf to go into da old abaandond miynes owtside of town now and find da Mummy.}